                                                "sense_id": "13bb2126-1a0d-363c-95ba-f4a992b71380",
                                                "text": "To e-mail a zip file, you need to attach the zip file to an e-mail message."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1ed5bf5-d7d3-4104-bb92-986b7d682ae7",
                                                "sense_id": "13bb2126-1a0d-363c-95ba-f4a992b71380",
                                                "text": "Because zip is not just a compression format like deflation or gzip but an archival format, a single zip file often contains multiple [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4943eb84-af58-44f5-a448-ae34f290a954",
                                                "sense_id": "13bb2126-1a0d-363c-95ba-f4a992b71380",
                                                "text": "However, pipes can't be used to read SAS data sets from a zip file in this way. Pipes are used with FILENAME [...]. There is a way to read and write SAS data sets that are stored in a zip file."
